      "created_at": "2019-12-04T18:40:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It occurred to me to be surprised that we haven't gotten a full Endlings episode yet.&nbsp; We know a little about them, but it would be cool to learn more about their species, how they died out, and the personalities of some of the individual survivors.&nbsp; Like, clearly they have a better feel for who Urdid is than what's been captured in the cards.&nbsp; And I'd love to hear the story of the Xarabians.&nbsp; (Unfortunately I'm not doing the Patreon--$10/month is too much for me.)</p>",
